Package: metewand
Title: Define Metewand Benchmarks with R Functions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Johan", "Larsson", email = "johan@jolars.co", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Define data generators, computational methods, and independent
    evaluators as ordinary R functions for Metewand benchmarks. Handles the
    version-1 worker protocol, canonical JSON, artifact inventories, and lifecycle
    callbacks over dedicated pipes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: digest, stats, utils
SystemRequirements: C++17 with floating-point std::to_chars; R >= 4.3 and
    matching Rtools on Windows
NeedsCompilation: yes
URL: https://github.com/jolars/metewand
